 <h3><u>Aap aajae jo maula</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>aap aajae jo maula hum ye manzar dekhlein<br> halqae matam bana kaabe ke andar dekhlein</p> 
  <p>aap ke zakir ki hai meraj mimbar aapka<br> aur aap mimbar par ho hum meraj e mimbar dekhlein</p> 
  <p>inteqame karbala ki de ali akbar azaa<br> murtuza ki tegh se udte hue sar dekhlein</p> 
  <p>hum isi lalach me peete hai mae hubbe ali<br> aabe kausar aapke chullu me peekar dekhle</p> 
  <p>wo to ghazi hai agar mai bangaya tera ghulam<br> arey meri thokar me jahaa wale samandar dekhlein</p> 
  <p>daaen buzar baaen qambar saamne salmaan ho<br> ek namaz aisi bhi hum kaabe me padhkar dekhlein</p> 
  <p>munkire ailane khum pe jis tarah kankar gira<br> munkire matam pe bhi yu girte patthar dekhlein</p> 
  <p>mehdiye qayam ka hoga aapke ghar me qayaam<br> arey farshe majlis aap bhi ghar me bichakar dekhlein</p> 
